        "seoTitle": "Soboro Bread Recipe – Korean Peanut Streusel Buns",
        "seoDescription": "Make 8 Korean soboro buns with soft yeast dough and a crumbly peanut topping. Follow the steps, separate dough and topping amounts, and choose suitable flour.",
        "description": [
          {
            "_key": "soboro-en-intro",
            "_type": "block",
            "style": "normal",
            "markDefs": [],
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "soboro-en-intro-text",
                "_type": "span",
                "text": "Soboro bread (soboro-ppang, 소보로빵) is a Korean bakery bun with soft yeast dough and a sweet, crumbly peanut topping. This recipe makes 8 buns and includes the dough, the soboro topping and both rises. Peanut butter gives the topping its distinctive flavor, while almond flour is also included in this version.",
                "marks": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "_key": "soboro-en-amounts-heading",
            "_type": "block",
            "style": "h2",
            "markDefs": [],
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "soboro-en-amounts-heading-text",
                "_type": "span",
                "text": "Separate the dough and topping ingredients",
                "marks": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "_key": "soboro-en-amounts",
            "_type": "block",
            "style": "normal",
            "markDefs": [],
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "soboro-en-amounts-text",
                "_type": "span",
                "text": "The ingredient checklist shows combined totals for shopping. Before mixing, set aside 200 g flour, 30 g sugar, 30 g butter and 3 g salt for the dough. For the topping, keep 80 g flour, 60 g sugar, 50 g butter and 1 g salt separate. The peanut butter, almond flour, baking powder and honey belong to the topping; the yeast, milk and egg belong to the dough.",
                "marks": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "_key": "soboro-en-flour-heading",
            "_type": "block",
            "style": "h2",
            "markDefs": [],
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "soboro-en-flour-heading-text",
                "_type": "span",
                "text": "Choosing flour where you live",
                "marks": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "_key": "soboro-en-flour-link",
            "_type": "block",
            "style": "normal",
            "markDefs": [
              {
