                "text": "The recipe uses ",
                "marks": []
              },
              {
                "_key": "soboro-en-flour-link-b",
                "_type": "span",
                "text": "Type 550 wheat flour",
                "marks": ["soboro-en-flour-link-link"]
              },
              {
                "_key": "soboro-en-flour-link-c",
                "_type": "span",
                "text": ". If that label is unfamiliar, the ingredient guide explains what it means and how to choose a flour suitable for soft yeast buns. Plain or all-purpose wheat flour labels vary by country and brand, so compare the intended baking use rather than the name alone.",
                "marks": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "_key": "soboro-en-rise-heading",
            "_type": "block",
            "style": "h2",
            "markDefs": [],
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "soboro-en-rise-heading-text",
                "_type": "span",
                "text": "Give the dough time to rise",
                "marks": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "_key": "soboro-en-rise",
            "_type": "block",
            "style": "normal",
            "markDefs": [],
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "soboro-en-rise-text",
                "_type": "span",
                "text": "Prepare the soboro mixture while the dough goes through its first rise, then press the topping gently onto the shaped buns. The rise times in the steps are guides: room and dough temperature affect how quickly yeast dough expands. In a cool kitchen, allow more time rather than moving on just because the timer has finished.",
                "marks": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "_key": "soboro-en-bake-heading",
            "_type": "block",
            "style": "h2",
            "markDefs": [],
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "soboro-en-bake-heading-text",
                "_type": "span",
                "text": "Baking and serving",
                "marks": []
              }
            ]
          },
