            "_key": "soboro-en-bake",
            "_type": "block",
            "style": "normal",
            "markDefs": [],
            "children": [
              {
                "_key": "soboro-en-bake-text",
                "_type": "span",
                "text": "The baking step uses 190°C, approximately 375°F. Let the buns cool slightly on a rack before serving, so the topping can settle. The listed total time includes resting and rising; it is not all hands-on work.",
                "marks": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "_key": "soboro-en-related",
